                                "text": "<h2 id=\"ch1-escaping\">Escaping</h2>\n<p>Everything that needs escaping, inside coloured tokens:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span style=\"color:#6a737d\">// A comment holding &lt;/span&gt; and A &amp; B\n</span><span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">String</span> markup = <span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;&lt;div class=\\&quot;box\\&quot;&gt;A &amp; B&lt;/div&gt;&quot;</span>;\n<span style=\"color:#d73a49\">boolean</span> ok = <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">1</span> &lt; <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">2</span> &amp;&amp; <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">3</span> &gt; <span style=\"color:#005cc5\">2</span>;\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>Markup inside markup:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span style=\"color:#22863a\">&lt;a</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">href</span>=<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;?a=1&amp;b=2&quot;</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">title</span>=<span style=\"color:#032f62\">&quot;A &amp;quot;quoted&amp;quot; title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#22863a\">&gt;</span>link<span style=\"color:#22863a\">&lt;/a&gt;\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n"
